  "body": "After deploying develop the federation send PDU metrics show a sharp increase in lag on senders 2 and 3 (but not 1 and 4):\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2021-04-22 10-33-04](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8428120/115699730-d5409e80-a35d-11eb-8874-c5a3d40c096c.png)\r\n\r\nWhile 4 sees a sharp decline in the counts:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2021-04-22 11-28-42](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/8428120/115699830-f3a69a00-a35d-11eb-81e0-1f46ccfd77a3.png)\r\n\r\nOne potentially related PR that was deployed at the time is https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/9702.\r\n\r\nThe CPU, memory usage and DB scheduling time of all federation senders look healthy and with no change.",
